    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds doable. Can you expand more on the \"threat actor\" side of things? Like, why specifically are we doing this move from SMS to hardware keys? What kind of vulnerabilities are we actually trying to close up?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
